/attachments/production/9216714978/original/ZaFmkpc7zuacJ_KuwxkpSycrHg0p43pXEA.png?1723713812\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9216714978\" data-identifyelement=\"642\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"643\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"644\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"645\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"646\" dir=\"ltr\">Note - you will need to create a password which they will use to login with once you've created their user access.</strong></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"647\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.656; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"648\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"649\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"650\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.656; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"651\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">When bulk importing users please ensure <span data-identifyelement=\"652\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">these fields in the CSV file are populated, see image below:</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"653\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.656; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"654\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"655\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"656\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.656; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"657\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"658\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9216715007/original/s9_hEjLk5k2j7Yr_Z-5mTHKHebxVBYnI1w.png?1723713874\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9216715007\" data-identifyelement=\"659\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"733\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"733\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"734\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"735\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"736\">User Permissions&nbsp;</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"737\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"738\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"739\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"740\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"741\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">The permissions will vary depending on whether the user is an accountant, staff or client</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"742\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"743\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"744\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"745\"><br dir=\"ltr\" data-identifyelement=\"746\"></strong></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"747\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"748\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"749\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"750\">Accountant Access&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"751\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"752\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"753\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"754\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"755\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"756\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"757\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">All modules will be accessible to an accountant, you can choose the clients the accountant sees, alternatively they can be the client manager for the clients. Accountants can also allocate Bank Feeds to the clients, as well as provide Hub Access.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"758\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"759\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"760\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"761\"></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"762\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"763\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"764\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Checking auto assign means any new clients created the accountant will automatically be able to access the client.</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"765\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"766\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"767\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"768\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9216717082/original/Ti73j7npifpPwnp3NRuCtD0JL9gL_UODcA.png?1723717069\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9216717082\" data-identifyelement=\"769\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"774\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"775\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"776\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"777\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"778\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"779\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"780\"><u data-identifyelement=\"781\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"782\"></u></strong></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"783\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"784\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"785\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"786\">Staff</strong></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"787\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"788\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"789\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"790\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"791\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">The super-accountant will be able to assign certain or all clients and modules to staff users. &nbsp;</span></span><span data-identifyelement=\"792\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"793\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Without the module access being ticketed that staff member will not see that particular module.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"794\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"795\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"796\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"797\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"798\" style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><u data-identifyelement=\"799\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9216717188/original/nNV8eyIMF2iaq-a12nmRNZtV3aPQIojPiQ.png?1723717231\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9216717188\" data-identifyelement=\"800\"></u></